    oneshot:`Founder pricing happens once. When it's gone, it's gone. Get in while the door's open.`+CTA,
    frontrow:`Every big thing had an early crowd — the ones who saw it first. This is that moment.`+CTA,
    shapeit:`Some people join communities. Others help shape them — before the polished version, before everyone knows the name. We're looking for those people.`+CTA,
    earlyinfluence:`This isn't early access. It's early influence. Founders won't just enter what we're building — they'll be part of its beginning.`+CTA,
    firstseats:`We saved the first seats for a reason — for builders, question-askers, idea-chasers who'll say "I don't have it all figured out, but I'm ready to."`+CTA,
    ninety2:`61% of people have a business idea. 92% never act on it. The 8% who do aren't smarter — they're bolder. Be bold. Stand apart.\n(Harris Poll for Zapier, 2020.)`+CTA,
    flock2:`Everyone's waiting for permission — 92% of people with an idea never start. Don't follow the herd. Join the Flock. 🐑\n(Harris Poll for Zapier, 2020.)`+CTA,
    rise:`How long has your idea been sitting there? 92% let theirs fade. This is your sign. From thought to thrive.\n(Harris Poll for Zapier, 2020.)`+CTA,
    spark:`The creator economy is a $250B+ industry heading toward $2 trillion. It's not saturated — it's waiting for your spark.\n(Grand View Research; Fortune Business Insights.)`+CTA,
    ideas:`Digital, POD, printables, merch… and no clue which to build first? Pick one. Ship it. The Haus shows you how.`+CTA,
    objection:`"I'm not techy." "I don't have time." "AI overwhelms me." Good — that's exactly who it's for. Start before you feel ready.`+CTA,
    brandna:`Who is your brand, really? 11 archetypes — one of them is you. One of eleven. One of one. Clarity, not guesswork.`+CTA,
    niche:`Niche what? Niche who? Niche 'n' YOU. Let's find the lane that fits what you do.`+CTA,
    onlyyou:`Thousands sell the exact same product. Only yours has you. Same shelf, different soul.`+CTA,
    original:`A whole flock, all the same… then there's you — the one who does it your way. Born an original. Don't die a copy. 🐑`+CTA,
    brandtree:`You don't have a brand. You ARE the brand. Your fingerprint. Your roots. Your mark. No one else has your print.`+CTA,
    purpose:`Somewhere, you went grey. Blended in. Played it safe. Then you remembered your why — and the color came back. Don't die a copy.`+CTA,
    purposeborn:`You weren't born by accident. You were born on purpose — for a purpose. That idea you keep coming back to? It was put there. Let's walk your journey together.`+CTA,
    mindset:`Your business grows at the speed of your mindset. That's why every day in the Haus starts with a Mindset Moment. Think different, build different.`+CTA,
    heart:`People don't buy what you make — they buy why you make it. Create from the heart. The tools are easy; the heart is you.`+CTA,
    purposecall:`A goal keeps you busy. A purpose keeps you going. When the hard days come, your why carries you. Purpose 2 Profit — it's in the name for a reason.`+CTA,
    bethereason:`Somewhere, someone has a problem only you can solve. Your gift was never just for you — it's for them. Be the reason someone smiles today. 🌟`+CTA,
    chooseyou:`The smallest choice can make the biggest impact. Choose to start. Choose to try. Choose YOU. From thought to thrive.`+CTA,
    provewrong:`The voice in your head says you can't. It's allowed to talk — it doesn't get to decide. Rise anyway, and let your actions prove it wrong.`+CTA,
    sayyoudid:`They said you can't. Take the chance anyway — not to prove them wrong, but so one day you can say: I did.`+CTA,
    standapart:`It's easier to pull you down than to rise up to meet you — so some people will try. Let them. It's okay to stand apart. Born an original. 🐑`+CTA,
    ideatired:`You've researched it. Saved posts about it. Talked yourself into it — and right back out. Your idea needs more than your attention. It needs your decision.`+CTA,
    anothersign:`You asked for a sign. Then another. Then called the third one "coincidence." Meanwhile that idea keeps tapping your shoulder… Maybe it's not another sign. Maybe it's a start.`+CTA,
    beforeproof:`Nobody talks about this part of starting — becoming someone who trusts herself enough to begin, before there's proof it'll work. That's the work before the work. And we do it here.`+CTA,
    comfortzone:`Your comfort zone has excellent customer service. Remembers your name, knows your excuses, never asks you to risk a thing. ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ "Would recommend — if your goal is to stay exactly where you are." But that's not why you're here.`+CTA,
    ideaproblem:`You don't have an idea problem. 47 ideas, three notebooks, a Canva folder that deserves its own zip code. Your problem is turning ONE into something real. That's where we come in.`+CTA,
    notprocrastinating:`Maybe you're not procrastinating. Maybe you're scared that once you try, you'll find out if you're capable. Plot twist: you build self-trust by keeping promises to yourself. Start with one.`+CTA,
    quityourlife:`Keep the job. Pick up the kids. Make dinner. Build anyway. You don't need a dramatic reinvention — you need somewhere to start.`+CTA,
    startingmessy:`Your first design might be ugly. Your first post might get 11 views. And? We're building a business, not auditioning for perfection. Starting messy is still starting.`+CTA,
    oneyear:`One year from now has entered the chat. She has questions: Did we start? Did we stop overthinking it? Or are we still "getting ready"? Your move.`+CTA,
    purposecheck:`✓ PURPOSE CHECK: Are you waiting to discover your purpose… or overlooking the thing you already do extraordinarily well? Your purpose isn't hiding — you've been calling your gift "ordinary."`+CTA,
    mindsetcheck:`✓ MINDSET CHECK: Your mind can build 100 reasons not to start before you give yourself one reason to believe you can. Maybe the first thing to build is belief. (Or… how long are we calling it "research" when it's really fear in glasses? 👀)`+CTA,
    heartcheck:`✓ HEART CHECK: Is the dream gone… or did life just get loud enough that you stopped listening? Some dreams don't disappear. They wait. Time to make it real.`+CTA,
    raft:`Got an idea but lost at sea? Get on the RAFT — Relieve, Act, Fast Win, Traction. Your weekly loop from drifting to shipping.`+CTA,
    grows:`"I'll figure it out" is not a plan. GROWS: Ground Zero, Roadmap, Ownership, Window, Success Vision. (G+R)×O×W=S. A plan you'll actually finish.`+CTA,
    rooted:`You're ready — so why aren't you launched? ROOTED: Reach, Open, Offer, Trigger, Escalate, Deepen. From ready → launched.`+CTA,
    getrooted:`Idea to income, in four moves: Brand → Product → Market → Launch. Get ROOTED. Grow deep, rise strong.`+CTA,
    community:`Building alone is the hard way. Your flock is forming — share a win, ask anything, get cheered on. Founding members wanted. 🐑`+CTA,
    courses:`Most courses are a pile of videos you never finish. Ours is a path — 5 realms, 50+ courses, learn by doing.`+CTA,
    game:`What if growing your business felt like a game? Points, streaks, badges, ranks — level up as you build.`+CTA,
    brand:`"Just be yourself." Cool — how? Your Brand DNA, mapped: voice, values, vibe, edge. Your fingerprint. Your brand.`+CTA,
    testtestimony:`Was it a test? Maybe. Turn that test into a testimony — it might be exactly what someone else needs to hear. Don't waste the story.`+CTA,
    messmessage:`Life got messy? Good. Turn that mess into a message. What you survived becomes what you use to serve. Don't waste it.`+CTA,
    setbacksetup:`You called it a setback. What if it was a set-up — a reroute toward the thing you were meant to build? Purpose has a funny way of finding you.`+CTA,
    redirection:`The door closed. You prayed, you pushed, you knocked again. Still closed. Maybe it wasn't punishment — maybe it was redirection, pointing you toward your purpose.`+CTA,
    builtyou:`Plot twist: the season you thought broke you may have been the one that built you. Now build something with it.`+CTA,
    prayedpurpose:`You prayed for purpose… then got annoyed when it showed up as a challenge, a lesson, and a whole lot of growth. Time to put it into action.`+CTA,
    movedaway:`Maybe you didn't lose your way. Maybe you were moved away from what no longer fit — so you could finally see what does. Detours can have purpose too.`+CTA,
    yourresume:`Stop disqualifying yourself because of your story. The mistakes. The pivots. The "I should've known better." Those aren't stains on your résumé — they ARE your résumé.`+CTA,
    expertise:`What if the thing you keep calling "just my experience" is actually expertise? What you've lived, learned, and overcome. Your story can serve. Your purpose can move.`+CTA,
    survived:`You survived the chapter you thought would break you. That wisdom was earned — and it doesn't have to end with you. Someone else may need what it taught you.`+CTA,
    mcresearch:`✓ MINDSET CHECK: How long are you going to call it "research" when you know it's really fear wearing glasses? 👀 You've learned enough. Time to build.`+CTA,
    mcears:`✓ MINDSET CHECK: Your biggest obstacle might not be in front of you — it might be the six inches between your ears. Win there first.`+CTA,
    mcroadblock:`✓ MINDSET CHECK: Your mind can build a roadblock faster than your hands can build a business. Build it anyway.`+CTA,
    mcending:`✓ MINDSET CHECK: You haven't failed. You haven't even started. Your mind just skipped ahead and wrote the ending. Write a different one.`+CTA,
    mcreasons:`✓ MINDSET CHECK: Funny how your brain finds 47 reasons something won't work before you give it ONE chance to. Give it the one.`+CTA,
    mcwhatif:`✓ MINDSET CHECK: Your mind said "What if I fail?" Your purpose said "Yeah… but what if you don't?"`+CTA,
    mcgoright:`✓ MINDSET CHECK: You've spent so long preparing for what could go wrong, you forgot to make room for what could go right. Make the room.`+CTA,
    mcproof:`✓ MINDSET CHECK: Your mind keeps demanding proof before you start. But starting is how you make the proof. So… start.`+CTA,
    mcseventeen:`✓ MINDSET CHECK: Your brain just created 17 problems for a business you haven't started yet. Respectfully… can we build it before we bury it?`+CTA,
    ordinaryextra:`Maybe your purpose isn't doing something no one's ever done. Maybe it's doing ordinary things extraordinarily well. Purpose isn't always a new idea — sometimes it's your way of doing the thing.`+CTA,
    nothingspecial:`What if the thing you keep calling "nothing special" is actually your gift? Stop overlooking what comes naturally to you — that's usually where your purpose is hiding.`+CTA,
    comesnaturally:`Stop overlooking what comes naturally to you. The stuff that feels too easy to be valuable? That's often your gift — ordinary to you, extraordinary to the people you serve.`+CTA,
    somethingbigger:`Maybe you weren't called to do something bigger. Maybe you were called to bring something bigger to what you already do. Same work — bigger why.`+CTA,
    lifewaiting:`You keep waiting for your life to change. Respectfully… your life is waiting on you. Purpose doesn't move until you do.`+CTA,
    desiredecision:`You can want it deeply and still never have it. Desire is not a decision. Action is. At some point the dream stops needing more thought — it needs a yes, a move, and you.`+CTA,
    heartknows:`Your heart already knows. Your mind is just filing appeals. Respectfully… the verdict may already be in.`+CTA,
    currentyou:`You don't need another version of you. You need the current one to stop handing her power to doubt, timing, and fear. Take it back.`+CTA,
    meethalfway:`The life you keep imagining is not going to introduce itself. You have to meet it halfway — and build it.`+CTA,
    prayworkon:`You can pray about it. Dream about it. Journal about it. At some point, you still have to work on it.`+CTA,
    potentialeffort:`Potential is powerful. But potential without effort is just a really good idea that never got a chance to become anything else. Build it.`+CTA,
    figureitout:`You don't have to have it all figured out. But you do have to be willing to figure it out as you go. Time to climb.`+CTA,
    ingroundgrow:`You don't need to work yourself into the ground. But you do need to put enough into the ground for something to grow. Time to thrive.`+CTA,
  };

  const GROUPS=[
    ['▶ Start here',['stack','thrive','home','franruth']],
    ['🚀 Launching soon',['founding','countdown','thelist','founderentrance','whynow','oneshot','frontrow','shapeit','earlyinfluence','firstseats']],
    ['📊 Hooks & stats',['ninety2','flock2','rise','spark','ideas','objection']],
    ['🖤 Identity',['brandna','niche','onlyyou','original','brandtree','purpose','purposeborn']],
    ['💜 Heart & mindset',['mindset','heart','purposecall']],
    ['🔥 Thought-provoking',['bethereason','chooseyou','provewrong','sayyoudid','standapart']],
    ['🧠 Real talk',['ideatired','anothersign','beforeproof','comfortzone','ideaproblem','notprocrastinating','quityourlife','startingmessy','oneyear']],
    ['✓ Check Yourself',['purposecheck','mindsetcheck','heartcheck','mcresearch','mcears','mcroadblock','mcending','mcreasons','mcwhatif','mcgoright','mcproof','mcseventeen']],
    ['📖 Your Story',['testtestimony','messmessage','setbacksetup','redirection','builtyou','prayedpurpose','movedaway','yourresume','expertise','survived']],
    ['🌟 Ordinary → Extraordinary',['ordinaryextra','nothingspecial','comesnaturally','somethingbigger']],
    ['💪 Do the Work',['lifewaiting','desiredecision','heartknows','currentyou','meethalfway','prayworkon','potentialeffort','figureitout','ingroundgrow']],
    ['🧭 Frameworks',['raft','grows','rooted','getrooted']],
    ['✨ Inside the Haus',['community','courses','game','brand']],
  ];
  let current='stack', timers=[];
  const reelsEl=$('#reels');
  const reelsEl2=reelsEl;

  /* ---------- CREATE-ONCE STUDIO ---------- */
  const PLAT=[['tt','TikTok'],['ig','Reels'],['yt','Shorts'],['pin','Pinterest'],['li','LinkedIn'],['fb','Facebook']];
  const PNAME=Object.fromEntries(PLAT);
  const HASH_FULL='#creatoreconomy #digitalproducts #printondemand #sidehustle #contentcreator #passiveincome #etsyseller #foundingmember #purposetoprofit #bornanoriginal';
  const AUD='Built for digital content creators, POD sellers & digital-product makers (Etsy, KDP, planners, printables) — and anyone sitting on an idea they haven’t shipped yet.';
  const load=(k,d)=>{ try{ return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(k))||d; }catch(e){ return d; } };
  const save=(k,v)=>{ try{ localStorage.setItem(k,JSON.stringify(v)); }catch(e){} };
  let posted=load('p2p_posted_v1',{}), custom=load('p2p_custom_v1',[]), calendar=load('p2p_calendar_v1',{}), vaultCustom=load('p2p_oneliners_v1',[]);

  function bodyOf(id){ return (SCRIPTS[id]||'').split(CTA)[0].trim(); }
  function platformize(id,p){ const b=bodyOf(id); switch(p){
    case 'tt':  return b+'\n\n💬 Comment "FLOCK" for the way into the Founding Flock 🐑\n\n#creatoreconomy #digitalproducts #sidehustle #foundingmember #purposetoprofit';
    case 'ig':  return b+'\n\n'+AUD+'\n\n💬 Comment "FLOCK" and I’ll DM you the way into the Founding Flock — founder pricing, first through the doors, + free goodies. 🐑\n\n'+HASH_FULL;
    case 'yt':  return b+'\n\n💬 Comment "FLOCK" for early access to the Founding Flock — founder pricing + free goodies.\n\n#Shorts #creatoreconomy #digitalproducts #sidehustle #contentcreator';
    case 'pin': return b+'\n\n'+AUD+'\n\n📌 Save this — then join the Founding Flock (founder pricing + free goodies). Link in profile.\n\n#digitalproducts #etsyseller #sidehustle #creatorbusiness #printondemand';
    case 'li':  return b+'\n\n'+AUD+'\n\nIf you’re building something of your own, comment "FLOCK" and I’ll share how to join our founding group — founder pricing and early access.\n\n#CreatorEconomy #Entrepreneurship #DigitalProducts';
    case 'fb':  return b+'\n\nComment "FLOCK" below and I’ll send you the way into the Founding Flock — founder pricing, first in, + free goodies. 🐑\n\n#creatoreconomy #digitalproducts #sidehustle';
  } return b; }

  // ---- custom reels: register into REELS/SCRIPTS from storage ----
  function registerCustom(){ custom.forEach(c=>{ const per=1500; let t=0;
    const steps=[[0,()=>render(title('',c.beats[0]||c.label,''))]];
    for(let i=1;i<c.beats.length;i++){ t+=per; const b=c.beats[i]; steps.push([t,()=>render(lead(b))]); }
    t+=per; steps.push([t,()=>render(cta())]);
    REELS[c.id]={label:c.label,total:t+2400,steps,custom:true};
    SCRIPTS[c.id]=c.beats.join('\n\n')+CTA;
  }); }

  // ---- menu (rebuildable) ----
  let ALL=[], reelBtns={}, accs=[], curPlat='tt', filter='all', query='';
  function groupsForMenu(){ const g=GROUPS.slice(); if(custom.length) g.push(['⭐ My Reels',custom.map(c=>c.id)]); return g; }
  function buildMenu(){ reelsEl2.innerHTML=''; reelBtns={}; accs=[]; ALL=[];
    groupsForMenu().forEach(([title2,ids],gi)=>{
      const valid=ids.filter(id=>REELS[id]); ALL.push(...valid);
      const d=document.createElement('details');d.className='reelacc';if(gi===0)d.open=true;
      const s=document.createElement('summary');s.className='reelsum';s.innerHTML=title2+'<span class="reelcount">'+valid.length+'</span>';d.appendChild(s);
      const row=document.createElement('div');row.className='reelrow';
      valid.forEach(id=>{ const b=document.createElement('button');b.className='reel'+(id===current?' active':'');b.textContent=REELS[id].label;b.dataset.id=id;b.onclick=()=>select(id);row.appendChild(b);reelBtns[id]=b; });
      d.appendChild(row);reelsEl2.appendChild(d);accs.push({el:d,ids:valid});
    });
  }

  function isPosted(id){ const o=posted[id]; return !!(o&&Object.keys(o).length); }
  function updateCount(){ $('#charCount').textContent=$('#sbText').value.length+' chars'; }
  function renderTabs(){ const t=$('#sbTabs'); t.innerHTML=''; PLAT.forEach(([k,name])=>{ const b=document.createElement('button'); const done=posted[current]&&posted[current][k]; b.className='sb-tab'+(k===curPlat?' active':'')+(done?' done':''); b.innerHTML=name+'<span class="sb-tdot"></span>'; b.onclick=()=>{ curPlat=k; renderCaption(); renderTabs(); }; t.appendChild(b); }); }
  function renderCaption(){ $('#sbText').value=platformize(current,curPlat); $('#copyPlat').textContent=PNAME[curPlat]; updateCount(); }
  function renderDots(){ const d=$('#sbDots'); d.innerHTML=''; PLAT.forEach(([k,name])=>{ const on=posted[current]&&posted[current][k]; const b=document.createElement('button'); b.className='pdot'+(on?' on':''); b.textContent=name; b.title='Mark '+name+(on?' — not posted':' — posted'); b.onclick=()=>{ posted[current]=posted[current]||{}; if(posted[current][k]) delete posted[current][k]; else posted[current][k]=1; if(!Object.keys(posted[current]).length) delete posted[current]; save('p2p_posted_v1',posted); renderDots(); renderTabs(); refreshMenu(); }; d.appendChild(b); }); }
  function select(id){ if(!REELS[id]) id='stack'; current=id; Object.keys(reelBtns).forEach(k=>reelBtns[k].classList.toggle('active',k===id)); $('#playLabel').textContent=REELS[id].label; $('#sbTitle').textContent=REELS[id].label; renderTabs(); renderCaption(); renderDots(); stop(); scenes.innerHTML=''; $('#playbtn').classList.remove('hide'); $('#progBar').style.transition='none'; $('#progBar').style.width='0'; }

  function refreshMenu(){
    ALL.forEach(id=>reelBtns[id]&&reelBtns[id].classList.toggle('posted',isPosted(id)));
    $('#progress').textContent='Posted '+ALL.filter(isPosted).length+' / '+ALL.length;
    const q=query.trim().toLowerCase();
    accs.forEach(a=>{ let vis=0; a.ids.forEach(id=>{ let ok=true;
      if(q) ok=(REELS[id].label||'').toLowerCase().includes(q)||(SCRIPTS[id]||'').toLowerCase().includes(q);
      if(ok&&filter==='todo') ok=!isPosted(id);
      if(ok&&filter==='done') ok=isPosted(id);
      reelBtns[id].classList.toggle('hide',!ok); if(ok) vis++;
    }); a.el.classList.toggle('hide',vis===0); if(q&&vis) a.el.open=true; });
  }
  function rebuildAll(){ registerCustom(); buildMenu(); refreshMenu(); }

  $('#sbText').addEventListener('input',updateCount);
  $('#copyBtn').onclick=()=>{ const b=$('#copyBtn'); navigator.clipboard.writeText($('#sbText').value).then(()=>{ const h=b.innerHTML; b.textContent='✓ Copied!'; b.classList.add('done'); setTimeout(()=>{ b.innerHTML=h; b.classList.remove('done'); },1400); }); };
  $('#search').addEventListener('input',e=>{ query=e.target.value; refreshMenu(); });
  $('#filters').addEventListener('click',e=>{ const b=e.target.closest('.fchip'); if(!b)return; filter=b.dataset.f; $('#filters').querySelectorAll('.fchip').forEach(c=>c.classList.toggle('active',c===b)); refreshMenu(); });
  $('#surprise').onclick=()=>{ let pool=ALL.filter(id=>!isPosted(id)); if(!pool.length) pool=ALL; const id=pool[Math.floor(Math.random()*pool.length)]; const a=accs.find(x=>x.ids.includes(id)); if(a) a.el.open=true; select(id); reelBtns[id].scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'}); };

  /* ---------- MODALS ---------- */
  function openModal(sel){ $(sel).classList.add('open'); }
  ROOT.querySelectorAll('.modal').forEach(m=>{ m.addEventListener('click',e=>{ if(e.target===m||e.target.closest('.modal-x')) m.classList.remove('open'); }); });
  document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{ if(e.key==='Escape') ROOT.querySelectorAll('.modal.open').forEach(m=>m.classList.remove('open')); });

  /* ---------- CONTENT CALENDAR ---------- */
  const MON=['January','February','March','April','May','June','July','August','September','October','November','December'];
  const DOW=['Sun','Mon','Tue','Wed','Thu','Fri','Sat'];
  const SHORTP={tt:'TT',ig:'IG',yt:'YT',pin:'PIN',li:'LI',fb:'FB'};
  let calView=new Date(); calView.setDate(1);
  function dkey(y,m,d){ return y+'-'+String(m+1).padStart(2,'0')+'-'+String(d).padStart(2,'0'); }
  function renderCal(){
    const y=calView.getFullYear(), m=calView.getMonth();
    $('#calTitle').textContent=MON[m]+' '+y;
    const first=new Date(y,m,1).getDay(), days=new Date(y,m+1,0).getDate();
    const now=new Date(), tkey=dkey(now.getFullYear(),now.getMonth(),now.getDate());
    let h=DOW.map(d=>'<div class="cal-dow">'+d+'</div>').join('');
    for(let i=0;i<first;i++) h+='<div class="cal-cell empty"></div>';
    for(let d=1;d<=days;d++){ const k=dkey(y,m,d); const items=calendar[k]||[];
      h+='<div class="cal-cell'+(k===tkey?' today':'')+'"><div class="cal-d">'+d+'</div>'+
        items.map((it,idx)=>{ const lab=REELS[it.id]?REELS[it.id].label:'(removed)'; return '<div class="cal-chip" data-k="'+k+'" data-i="'+idx+'" title="'+(PNAME[it.plat]||'')+' — click to remove"><i>'+(SHORTP[it.plat]||'')+'</i>'+lab+'</div>'; }).join('')+
        '<button class="cal-add" data-k="'+k+'">＋</button></div>';
    }
    $('#calGrid').innerHTML=h;
  }
  $('#calGrid').addEventListener('click',e=>{
    const add=e.target.closest('.cal-add'); if(add){ const k=add.dataset.k; (calendar[k]=calendar[k]||[]).push({id:current,plat:curPlat}); save('p2p_calendar_v1',calendar); renderCal(); return; }
    const chip=e.target.closest('.cal-chip'); if(chip){ const k=chip.dataset.k,i=+chip.dataset.i; calendar[k].splice(i,1); if(!calendar[k].length) delete calendar[k]; save('p2p_calendar_v1',calendar); renderCal(); }
  });
  $('#calPrev').onclick=()=>{ calView.setMonth(calView.getMonth()-1); renderCal(); };
  $('#calNext').onclick=()=>{ calView.setMonth(calView.getMonth()+1); renderCal(); };
  $('#calBtn').onclick=()=>{ $('#calHint').innerHTML='Tap <b>＋</b> on a day to schedule: <b>'+REELS[current].label+'</b> · '+PNAME[curPlat]; renderCal(); openModal('#modalCal'); };

  /* ---------- CREATE YOUR OWN REEL ---------- */
  function renderNrList(){ const el=$('#nrList'); el.innerHTML = custom.length ? custom.map(c=>'<div class="nr-item"><span>'+c.label+'</span><button data-id="'+c.id+'" title="Delete">✕</button></div>').join('') : '<p class="muted">No custom reels yet — make your first one above.</p>'; }
  $('#nrList').addEventListener('click',e=>{ const b=e.target.closest('button[data-id]'); if(!b)return; const id=b.dataset.id; custom=custom.filter(c=>c.id!==id); delete REELS[id]; delete SCRIPTS[id]; if(posted[id]){ delete posted[id]; save('p2p_posted_v1',posted); } save('p2p_custom_v1',custom); if(current===id) current='stack'; rebuildAll(); renderNrList(); if(!REELS[current]) select('stack'); });
  $('#saveReel').onclick=()=>{
    const label=$('#nrLabel').value.trim(); const beats=$('#nrBeats').value.split('\n').map(s=>s.trim()).filter(Boolean);
    if(!label||!beats.length){ $('#nrErr').textContent='Add a title and at least one line.'; return; }
    const id='my'+Date.now(); custom.push({id,label,beats}); save('p2p_custom_v1',custom);
    rebuildAll(); const a=accs.find(x=>x.ids.includes(id)); if(a) a.el.open=true; select(id);
    $('#nrLabel').value=''; $('#nrBeats').value=''; $('#nrErr').textContent=''; renderNrList();
    $('#modalNew').classList.remove('open');
  };
  $('#newBtn').onclick=()=>{ renderNrList(); openModal('#modalNew'); };

  /* ---------- ONE-LINER VAULT ---------- */
  const VAULT_SEED=["Born an original. Don't die a copy.","Start before you feel ready.","Your comfort zone has excellent customer service. Leave anyway.","You don't have an idea problem. You have a starting problem.","Saving posts isn't the same as starting.","Confidence comes after the first step, not before it.","Potential without effort is just a good idea that never happened.","They can copy the product. They can't copy you.","You weren't born to blend in.","One year from now you'll wish you started today. So start today.","Your mess is your message.","Build it anyway.","The door didn't close on you. It redirected you.","Stop researching your fear and call it what it is.","Make something real.","Not ready isn't the same as not able.","You don't have a brand. You ARE the brand.","Your chapter 1 is not their chapter 20.","Done is better than perfect — and it actually ships.","Do it scared."];
  function vaultAll(){ return VAULT_SEED.concat(vaultCustom); }
  function renderVault(){ $('#vaultList').innerHTML = vaultAll().map((t,i)=>{ const isC=i>=VAULT_SEED.length; return '<div class="vault-item"><span>'+t.replace(/</g,'&lt;')+'</span><div class="vault-btns"><button class="vault-copy" data-t="'+encodeURIComponent(t)+'" title="Copy">⧉</button>'+(isC?'<button class="vault-del" data-i="'+(i-VAULT_SEED.length)+'" title="Delete">✕</button>':'')+'</div></div>'; }).join(''); }
  $('#vaultList').addEventListener('click',e=>{ const c=e.target.closest('.vault-copy'); if(c){ navigator.clipboard.writeText(decodeURIComponent(c.dataset.t)); const o=c.textContent; c.textContent='✓'; setTimeout(()=>c.textContent=o,1000); return; } const d=e.target.closest('.vault-del'); if(d){ vaultCustom.splice(+d.dataset.i,1); save('p2p_oneliners_v1',vaultCustom); renderVault(); } });
  $('#vaultAdd').onclick=()=>{ const v=$('#vaultInput').value.trim(); if(!v)return; vaultCustom.push(v); save('p2p_oneliners_v1',vaultCustom); $('#vaultInput').value=''; renderVault(); };
  $('#vaultInput').addEventListener('keydown',e=>{ if(e.key==='Enter') $('#vaultAdd').click(); });
  $('#vaultBtn').onclick=()=>{ renderVault(); openModal('#modalVault'); };

  // ---- init ----
  registerCustom(); if(!REELS[current]) current='stack'; buildMenu(); select(current); refreshMenu();
  function stop(){ timers.forEach(clearTimeout); timers=[]; }
  let speed=1.35; const SPEEDS=[1,1.35,1.6];
  function play(){ stop(); const R=REELS[current]; const bar=$('#progBar'); const T=R.total/speed;
    bar.style.transition='none';bar.style.width='0';void bar.offsetWidth;bar.style.transition='width '+T+'ms linear';bar.style.width='100%';
    R.steps.forEach(([t,fn])=>timers.push(setTimeout(fn,t/speed)));
    timers.push(setTimeout(()=>{ if($('#loopState').textContent==='on') play(); }, T)); }
  $('#speed').onclick=()=>{ speed=SPEEDS[(SPEEDS.indexOf(speed)+1)%SPEEDS.length]; $('#speedState').textContent=speed+'×'; };
  $('#playbtn').onclick=()=>{ $('#playbtn').classList.add('hide'); play(); };
  $('#replay').onclick=()=>{ $('#playbtn').classList.add('hide'); play(); };
  $('#loop').onclick=()=>{const s=$('#loopState');s.textContent=s.textContent==='on'?'off':'on';};
  $('#recBtn').onclick=()=>{ ROOT.classList.add('rec'); window.scrollTo(0,0); };
  $('#exitRec').onclick=()=>{ ROOT.classList.remove('rec'); };
  $('#recReplay').onclick=()=>{ $('#playbtn').classList.add('hide'); play(); };

</script>
